## 6. 顺带发现的第二个 P1（已修复）：Console 菜品更新/上下架 500

证据（并行 Stage5 节点 22:41 联调日志 artifacts/backend-8083-pa.log）：
2026-11-14T22:41:28.773+08:00 ERROR [3a09a188-a20b-4f21-99e5-07cb12f1f942] [1] com.webox.admin.AuditService - Audit write failed for DISH_UPDATE 9: com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.exc.InvalidDefinitionException: Java 8 da
2026-11-14T22:41:28.820+08:00 ERROR [6d958087-35e7-473d-a1a4-d265f350b1d4] [1] com.webox.admin.AuditService - Audit write failed for DISH_UPDATE 9: com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.exc.InvalidDefinitionException: Java 8 da
  -> AdminService.updateDish/updateDishStatus 的审计快照含 JDBC LocalDateTime，
     Util.MAPPER 未注册 JavaTimeModule -> InvalidDefinitionException -> 500 INTERNAL (违反 AC-033/AC-034 Console 菜品管理)。

### 修复 diff
--- a/backend/src/main/java/com/webox/common/Util.java
+++ b/backend/src/main/java/com/webox/common/Util.java
-    private static final ObjectMapper MAPPER = new ObjectMapper();
+    private static final ObjectMapper MAPPER = new ObjectMapper()
+            .registerModule(new com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype.jsr310.JavaTimeModule())
+            .disable(com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.SerializationFeature.WRITE_DATES_AS_TIMESTAMPS);

